WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 9.2 · Financial Management
The organisational budget

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Budget your whole first year from real prices, and plan what you will cut if income falls short.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Base each cost on a quote and write down the assumption.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Mark income confirmed, likely or possible.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Add a contingency line: first-year costs run high.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write your first-year budget headings and assumptions.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
